  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 9 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 9] M\u1ED9t meme h\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
      '\u0111\u1EA1o \u0111\u1EE9c' l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Chia s\u1EBB t\xE0i li\u1EC7u cho b\u1EA1n\u2026 sau khi nh\u1EADn m\xEC"
    - "Tag b\u1EA1n v\xE0o deadline"
    - "Nh\u1EAFn 't\u1EE5i m\xECnh ch\u1EBFt' r\u1ED3i ai c\u0169ng \u1ED5n"
    - "\u0102n team rank\u2026 \xFD l\xE0 \u0103n team project"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 9] N\u1EBFu stress l\xE0 thanh m\xE1u,
      thanh n\xE0o 'sai build'?"
    options:
    - "Lu\xF4n full nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn combat"
    - "Lu\xF4n 1% nh\u01B0ng v\u1EABn t\u1EF1 tin"
    - "Lu\xF4n 50% v\xEC 'c\xE2n b\u1EB1ng'"
    - "\u1EA8n thanh \u2014 v\xEC denial"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 9] C\xE1ch 'reset' sau m\u1ED9t ng\xE0y
      d\xE0i t\u1EC7 nh\u1EA5t l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "T\u1EAFm + nh\u1EA1c + kh\xF4ng m\u1EDF mail"
    - "Ng\u1EE7 v\xE0 m\u01A1 th\u1EA5y \u0111i\u1EC3m A"
    - "\u0110\u1EB7t b\xE1o th\u1EE9c 'ng\xE0y mai m\u1EDBi l\xE0 th\u1EE9 Hai'"
    - "U\u1ED1ng n\u01B0\u1EDBc (th\u1EADt)"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 9] Ch\u1ECDn 'thuy\u1EBFt \xE2m m\u01B0u'
      h\u1EE3p l\xFD nh\u1EA5t:"
    options:
    - "Deadline \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 test l\xF2ng
      tin"
    - "Wi-Fi ch\u1EADm khi c\u1EA7n n\u1ED9p b\xE0i"
    - "\u1ED4 c\u1EE9ng hay \u0111\u1EA7y \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc quan tr\u1ECDng"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u c\xF3 th\u1EC3 true c\xF9ng l\xFAc"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 9] T\u1ED1i nay b\u1EA1n ch\u1ECDn theme
      h\u1ECDc t\u1EADp n\xE0o?"
    options:
    - "Dark mode + c\xE0 ph\xEA + self doubt"
    - "Light mode + n\u01B0\u1EDBc l\u1ECDc + toxic positivity"
    - Sepia + jazz + vintage suffering
    - RGB + EDM + I'm fine
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
